p Hi #{USERNAME},
if TRIGGER_INACTIVITY
  if POLICY_OPERATOR
    p Under the policy of this platform, accounts are deleted after #{INACTIVITY_DAYS} days without use. Your account has not been used for a while: unless it is used before, it will be deleted on #{DEADLINE}, in #{DAYS_LEFT} days.
  else
    p Your account is set to be deleted after #{INACTIVITY_DAYS} days without use. It has not been used for a while: unless it is used before, it will be deleted on #{DEADLINE}, in #{DAYS_LEFT} days.
else
  p Your account is set to be deleted on #{DEADLINE}, in #{DAYS_LEFT} days.
p All the data of the account will then be erased, and this cannot be undone.
if EXPORT_URL
  p
    | To keep a copy of your data, download it before that date:
    |
    a(href=EXPORT_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{EXPORT_URL}
if TRIGGER_INACTIVITY
  p To keep your account, simply use it: signing in, or an app you connected, moves the date.
if ACCOUNT_APP_URL
  p
    | To change or cancel the deletion, sign in to your account page:
    |
    a(href=ACCOUNT_APP_URL target="_blank" rel="noopener") #{ACCOUNT_APP_URL}
else
  p To change or cancel the deletion, sign in to your account page.
